&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:8.9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:16pt;font-size:16pt;"&gt; &lt;/h4&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(1)  【株主総会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:17.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:18.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:17.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:18.5pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(2)  【取締役会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:17.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:18.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:17.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:18.5pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3)  【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:479.0pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:225.4pt;min-width:225.4pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:126.8pt;min-width:126.8pt;"/&gt;
